Audience words and phrases they use
title end

paragraph start
A plain list of the words and phrases the audience uses for its problems, goals and tools, copied exactly, including misspellings. It feeds captions, hooks, hashtags and search terms.
paragraph end

paragraph start
The list is never replaced by words the brand likes better.
